Command Effect When <code>/context</code> Show usage % and breakdown Anytime you're curious <code>/compact</code> Summarize the conversation, replace history with the summary Long session, same task, getting heavy <code>/clear</code> Wipe the conversation, start fresh in the same window Switching to an unrelated task <pre><code>flowchart TD
    Q{Next thing you'll do}
    Q --&gt;|Same task, continue| K{Context &gt; ~70%?}
    K --&gt;|yes| Compact["/compact"]
    K --&gt;|no| Go[Keep going]
    Q --&gt;|Different task| Clear["/clear (or new session)"]</code></pre> <p>Claude auto-compacts near the limit, so <code>/compact</code> is optional — but doing it yourself at a natural break gives a better summary. In the video, <code>/clear</code> dropped the session to ~37k tokens: that's the fixed baseline from tools and skills.</p>
